The diff explicitly adds shared styling for both `.groups` and `.badges` in `admin_base.scss`:

```scss
.groups, .badges {
  .form-horizontal {
    label { font-weight: bold; }
    & > div { margin-top: 10px; }
    input, textarea, select { width: 350px; }
    input[type="checkbox"] { width: 20px; }
  }
}
```

This will change label weight, margins, and input widths on the Badges admin page as wel
